# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
# COOP/COEP enable cross-origin isolation, the prerequisite for
# SharedArrayBuffer -> wasm threads (planned v1.3.x). All assets are
# self-hosted, so require-corp costs nothing today. Ignored by the
# desktop (Tauri) build, which serves this dir from its own webview.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
